<section class="py-24 border-t border-ink-border bg-ink-950 relative trust-gap">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-primary block mb-3 font-sans">
        Why a Website Matters
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-[clamp(1.75rem,2vw+1rem,2.75rem)] font-extrabold text-white mb-4 tracking-tight font-display">
        The Local Trust Gap
      </h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
        Noida customers search on Google Maps first. Here is what happens when they click your listing.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-stretch relative">
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-1/2 w-px bg-ink-border -translate-x-1/2"></div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between p-8 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-900 bg-ink-950 without-col z-20">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-semibold bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border border-red-500/20 mb-6">
            <svg class="w-3 h-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
            Without a Website
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Found on Google. Then what?</h3>
          
