            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
              <span>No way to see your services, menu, or pricing without making a call or visiting.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
              <span>No trust signals beyond standard Google ratings. Nothing showing your interior, team, or equipment.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
              <span>Customers guess at your hours, capabilities, and availability. Most will bounce.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
              <span>Easy to scroll past your listing to a competitor who has a professional link.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-8 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 text-[11px] text-zinc-500 font-sans space-y-2 select-none">
          <div class="font-bold text-zinc-300">Dental Clinic Near Noida Sec 62</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-amber-400 text-xs">★★★★☆</span>
            <span>4.2 (12 reviews) · Clinic</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full h-px bg-zinc-800 my-1"></div>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="text-zinc-600 font-semibold flex items-center">
